          "lines": [
            "          97 Jisu Guang Zaic Pwni the",
            "                         7.8.7. 8. Ref. 7. 9. 8",
            "          Doh hei. E",
            "",
            "          1. Jisu guang zaic pwni the;",
            "             Lwmloumei guay chamdaanv la tho.",
            "             Lwmlou makmei guay tei mu,",
            "             Pou' Khrista ta how pwlak khe.",
            "",
            "                       Lwmlouna chamdaanv la tho;",
            "                       Tingkauh kandic khou lungc niimei guay.",
            "                       Lungh laicna Kakhou guang la tho.",
            "",
            "          2. Tingkauh ramgai saa ngam mak.",
            "             Bw lev neih riw kage maek ge.",
            "             Tingkauh ramgai tei ch'ryn e;",
            "             Heicdi gaymei tingkauh ramc tei.",
            "",
            "          3. Tingkauh baanch' raa ruhkanei,",
            "             Kaniw baengkhuai tei sin lana.,",
            "             Laudai tei mincna bam the.",
            "             Laudai tei tay nimei rau e."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
